// Ch1 C1-09, bark 5 of 6: the outer mooring. The Seventh Terrace, a red-lacquered Pemakar copper
// coaster, loading salvage. Her skipper, Sadi Moru, bought a lamp-housing off Rhen and paid short;
// they argue amiably. The camera holds once on the carved name-board on her stern (the O07 insert,
// 1.5 s; Seeds Ch4: this is the derelict, act1_ch04.md C4-11). In-engine, with the one insert.
title: ch01_bark_outer_mooring
location: ch01/oruvel
---
// PC GPU QA pass 5, row 58: Sadi is in frame for her lines (O07_sadi, her single at the mooring); O07 stays the
// beat's one insert on the name-board, with no one in it.
@camera O07_sadi
Skipper_Sadi [smile]: Sallow! Come to complain about my arithmetic again? #line:ch01_bark_sadi_001
Rhen [smile]: You paid me for half a lamp-housing. I sold you a whole one. #line:ch01_bark_sadi_002
// M3-CIN-1235 (PC GPU QA row 58): O07 had been pressed against the hull's side with no board; it now looks at the
// name-board on her stern, and the insert ends before Sadi's answer, which she gives in the field camera.
@camera O07
@wait 1.5
@camera O07_sadi
Skipper_Sadi [laugh]: The other half was my company. We sail at the turn. #line:ch01_bark_sadi_003
@camera release
===
